+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+- The caller must be an org admin of the organization in the path. A caller
+  outside that organization → 404; a member who is not an org admin → 403.
+- The user must be in the organization in the path → 404 otherwise.
+- `toOrgId` must be present (400), must differ from the user's organization
+  (400), and must be an existing organization (400). An organization exists
+  when it has users.
+- The transfer removes the user's project memberships and unassigns the tasks
+  assigned to them (the old organization's projects no longer have the user).
+  It does not add the user to any project in the new organization.
+- Org admin rights do not carry over: the user is not an org admin in the new
+  organization.
+- The caller does not need to be an admin of the target organization.
+
